{"name":"Expert Chase: AI for Life","dev":"Expert Chase, Inc.","keys":["ios:6766313000"],"ios":{"id":"6766313000","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/expert-chase-ai-for-life/id6766313000?uo=4","rating":5,"ratings":1,"price":"Free","genre":"Productivity","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/b8/02/15/b80215aa-bca7-9baf-fd92-88390d5a902b/Expert_Chase_-_mobile_-_2026-09-06T182239.100.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/30/32/18/30321841-1622-6be0-7281-eb6c968025ec/Expert_Chase_-_mobile_-_2026-09-08T004230.751.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/60/15/ae/6015aea8-a2ba-2f82-d155-7b521457c76d/Expert_Chase_-_mobile_-_2026-09-07T032927.809.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/e3/09/f8/e309f830-f879-59de-f094-2a7809e9ef8a/Expert_Chase_-_mobile__U002898_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/60/d5/37/60d53736-e0db-8a35-4b27-56d31f762cc0/Expert_Chase_-_mobile__U002889_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/a1/64/c4/a164c496-768e-c8cf-1d74-d4ef2f3d25b3/Expert_Chase_-_mobile__U002865_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/49/33/cb/4933cbbe-5d3a-702b-40d3-585f068ab473/Expert_Chase_-_mobile_-_2026-09-07T041725.131.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/53/c0/9a/53c09a27-b2a9-3e7e-10db-d9d6a4ee23b3/Expert_Chase_-_mobile__U002899_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"We're on a mission to make AI actually useful in real life.\n\nExpert Chase helps you organize every aspect of everyday life in one place with our AI, E.Y.E. It draws on your real-life data and answers based on that data, not generic responses.\n\nReplace the clutter of all those little life-tracking apps people use every day: to-do, calendar, nutrition, sleep, fitness, notes, Everything.\n\nOne subscription. Unlimited AI. Plus integrations.\n\nE.Y.E. stands for “Empower Your Everyday.”\n\nWhat you can do:\n• Plan and manage tasks\n• Keep calendar events organized\n• Log, food, sleep, and workouts\n• Capture notes and ideas\n• Chat with E.Y.E. for help grounded in your life\n\nTerms of service & privacy policy:\nService Terms: https://www.expertchase.com/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.expertchase.com/privacy\n© 2026 Expert Chase, Inc.","released":"2026-07-08","updated":"2026-09-12","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/45/01/08/45010876-03f7-22bc-4a9a-07e9084e72ee/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/45/01/08/45010876-03f7-22bc-4a9a-07e9084e72ee/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Productivity","rating":5.0,"ratings":1,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":2,"hn_comments":1,"submissions":1,"self_n":1,"hn_score":2.58,"first":1789249290,"last":1789249290,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":49677495,"k":"ios:6766313000","type":"story","by":"E-Y-E","time":1789249290,"text":"","title":"AI for Life","story_id":49677495,"story_title":"AI for Life","story_score":2,"comments":1,"w":2.585,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"expert-chase-ai-for-life"}